\pard\b\fs20 Rock 'n Mountains\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Rock 'n Mountains are a large mountain range in the north of Camerica. Erosion created this unusual landscape. The inhabitants mainly use the canyons for competitions, but settling them can be interesting, too.\par
